From 128d7d0c56e83d33558079204600c394584bad20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ayushman Bhattacharya <ayushman.elixpo@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:20:04 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec, avformat: add RV565 decoder, encoder, demuxer and
 muxer

RV565 is a frame-independent RGB565 video container for microcontroller
displays such as ST7789 SPI panels on the ESP32: a 12-byte header followed
by length-prefixed zlib streams, each inflating to exactly width*height
big-endian RGB565 pixels.

Specification: https://github.com/elixpo/rv565/blob/main/docs/FORMAT.md
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.35935

Signed-off-by: Ayushman Bhattacharya <ayushman.elixpo@gmail.com>
